---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = '2026-06-22';
---
<Base
  title="Cookie Policy — 24Observe"
  description="How 24observe uses cookies and local storage. Essential session storage only — no advertising or cross-site tracking cookies."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 760px;">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span> Legal · last updated {updated}</div>
      <h1 class="h1">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 24px;">
        We keep this short because we keep cookies short. 24observe uses only what's needed to log you
        in and keep the product working — no advertising cookies, no cross-site tracking, no selling
        your data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top: 56px;">1. Strictly necessary</h2>
      <p>
        When you sign in to the dashboard, we store a <b>session/authentication token</b> (in a cookie
        and/or your browser's local storage) so you stay logged in and so requests can be attributed to
        your account securely. The product does not function without this; it is not used for tracking.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top: 48px;">2. Analytics — cookie-less</h2>
      <p>
        We measure aggregate site traffic with a privacy-friendly, <b>cookie-less</b> analytics tool
        (self-hosted Plausible). It sets no cookies, collects no personal data, and does not fingerprint
        or follow you across sites. There is nothing to consent to and nothing to opt out of.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top: 48px;">3. Payment provider</h2>
      <p>
        Checkout and the billing portal are hosted by our payment provider, Dodo Payments, on their own
        domains. When you're on those pages, their cookies/policies apply — see the provider's notices.
        We never receive or store your card details.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top: 48px;">4. No third-party tracking</h2>
      <p>
        We do not embed advertising networks, social-media trackers, or cross-site analytics on our
        marketing site or dashboard. Because we don't set non-essential cookies, we don't show a cookie
        consent banner — there's nothing to gate.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top: 48px;">5. Managing cookies</h2>
      <p>
        You can clear or block cookies in your browser settings at any time. Blocking the session cookie
        will simply sign you out of the dashboard. For how we handle personal data generally, see our
        <a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top: 48px;">6. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:support@24observe.com">support@24observe.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
